      "side": 1,
      "message": "Hmm, rather than try to keep this code perfectly in sync with the blitters, I think it\u0027s best to just have it use RP directly. I realize that pulls in RP as a dependency, but that\u0027s going to exist regardless - GPU already leans on it heavily for pixel conversions.\n\nIf we do that, we get correct behavior for all color types, and this code probably gets much simpler. Something like:\n\n```\nSkSTArenaAlloc\u003c256\u003e arena;\nSkRasterPipeline p(\u0026arena);\np.append_constant_color(\u0026arena, dstColor);\nuint64_t memsetColor;\nSkRasterPipeline_MemoryCtx ctx{\u0026memsetColor, 0};\np.append_store(ct, \u0026ctx);\np.run(0, 0, 1, 1);\n```",
      "revId": "f3614db1cebe677aa94cf47c8f3b684901291baa",
      "serverId": "5086850b-e599-37d2-8ec8-ff16aeccbf02"
    },
